   "widgets_values": [
    "Character turnaround reference sheet for a 3D game model. Exactly THREE full-body views of the same character, side by side in one row with wide empty space between them: on the left a front view looking at the viewer, in the middle a side profile view, on the right a back view showing the back of the head and body. Each view shows the whole body from the top of the head to the feet, standing straight in a relaxed A-pose with both arms down and slightly away from the body, identical pose and proportions in the three views, orthographic camera, no perspective, soft even studio lighting, plain uniform light grey background, no floor, no shadows, no text, no other figures. High quality 3D render, realistic proportions, detailed face."
   ],
   "title": "Regras da folha (não precisa mexer)",
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#333"
  },
